  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Union Alheri Par-Boiled Rice Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice.Beneficiaries: 120 (120 women).Description: Through the project, the union seeks to strengthen its financial and organizational capacity to improve members production and local marketing of parboiled and white rice. The grant funds will be used to train members in improved rice processing techniques and increase its processing capacity with better access to paddy rice. The union leadership will also benefit from financial and organizational management training and marketing opportunities to increase the unions sales.</narrative>
  </description>
